title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/recent
catalog: GUI command
target: recent
summary: Open a recently-viewed metarecord (here / other / new; by time / score)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shipped ``commands.js``

!! Default keys

* ``b g m`` → ``recent new score``
* ``b g r`` → ``recent new time``
* ``g m`` → ``recent other score``
* ``g r`` → ``recent other time``
* ``i g m`` → ``recent here score``
* ``i g r`` → ``recent here time``
* ``w g m`` → ``recent other score``
* ``w g r`` → ``recent other time``
